config REMOTEPROC_NRF_VPR
    bool "Nordic VPR"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_NORDIC_NRF54L15_VPR_ENABLED && SOC_NRF54L_CPUAPP
    help
      A VPR RISC-V core of an nRF54L, as the application core sees it:
      started from its firmware in the RRAM, with access to the secure
      peripherals.
